## Phased Implementation Plan

### Phase 1: Core Foundation & Luxury Web UI (Recommended First Step)
1. Update database schema for roles, departments, and advanced training logs.
2. Implement JWT Role-Based Auth on backend.
3. Overhaul the React frontend to the luxury dark/gold theme.
4. Build the Excel Import/Export employee module.

### Phase 2: Attendance & OJT
1. QR Code generation and validation backend endpoints.
2. OJT Module with checklist and rating system.
3. Analytics dashboard with charts.

### Phase 3: Integrations (OCR & Google Forms)
1. Setup Google Sheets API integration to pull form data.
2. Implement OCR pipeline for uploaded attendance sheets.

### Phase 4: Mobile & Output
1. Initialize Flutter application.
2. Implement PDF Certificate Generator.
3. Firebase Cloud Messaging push notifications.

