## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Postman/Jest tests for role-based API access.
- Unit tests for the Excel parsing logic.

### Manual Verification
- Testing Excel upload by uploading a CSV and verifying DB insertion.
- Testing QR generation visually on the web app.
- Compiling the Flutter app for Android/iOS to verify UI layout.
